Statue: The First Day has come.

Statue: The Marked Child is lost in fear, straying from the path that leads him home.

Statue: Go to his chamber.

Statue: Feed his body, and soothe his heart with Scripture.

Statue: Recite the sacred verses in full before the bell tolls a second time.

Statue: Remember, Executor.

Statue: Should mercy cause you to falter in the ritual, you shall have shown disrespect to the Divine.

