Bishop Lucian: I brought you something to eat.

The Holy Child: Don’t come any closer.

Bishop Lucian: Alright. I won’t.

The Holy Child: You said that before.

Bishop Lucian: I know.

The Holy Child: …You’re not going to make me eat it?

Bishop Lucian: No. Take it when you’re ready.
