Failure: Attacked Before Feeding

The Holy Child was frightened. The Executor failed in his duty.

Failure: Three Failed Recitations

The scripture of the First Day was broken by incorrect verses.

The Holy Child remained silent until the second bell tolled.

The statue offered no further guidance.

Failure: Forced Approach to the Cell

The Executor crossed the boundary of safety.

The Holy Child turned fear into his final defense.

The record of the First Day has been sealed.

After Failure

Restarting the First Day.

Successful Completion — Knife Undiscovered

Temple Record:

The First Day’s recitation is complete.
The Holy Child has ceased resisting. The ritual may continue.

The Holy Child:

The Holy Child sits with his knees drawn to his chest, avoiding your gaze.
His right hand remains pressed tightly against his side.

Knife Discovered — Removed by Force

Temple Record:

The First Day’s recitation is complete.
An object capable of disrupting the ritual has been removed.

The Holy Child:

The Holy Child sits with his back turned toward you.
His shoulders continue to tremble long after the blade is taken away.

Knife Discovered — Handled with Mercy

Temple Record:

The First Day’s recitation is complete.
The Holy Child has shown no further signs of aggression.

The Holy Child:

The Holy Child watches you set the blade aside. After a moment of silence, he slowly lowers his guard.

The Scripture of the Divine Mark
The mark chose you before birth.

The Window Beyond the Veil
Death opens softly into sacred light.

The Silent Oath
Silent hearts never question the divine path.

